  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "媽媽親像天"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>作者：</b></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>郭于中</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">人講「媽媽親像天」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Ē記得阮細漢ê時</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">逐工天tsiah拄拍phú光</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">老母就tsiok gâu早起來替阮tshuân三頓</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">細漢上愛媽媽伴我睏</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">雙手摸老母烏sìm-sìm ê頭毛</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Hōo我一醒到天光</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">「爸母疼囝長流水」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">細漢阮破病　身體無爽快</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一下吐　老母伸雙手隨倚來sîn</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Āinn我去hōo醫生看</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一筒射注tī阮ê頭殼皮</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">M̄甘tī老母ê心肝底</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">目屎kâm目墘</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Suà--落-來目屎四淋垂</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阮永遠記tī心肝底</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tī我心目中</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">伊是上平凡ê女性</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Mā是上偉大ê媽媽</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">M̄ bat拍囝、罵囝　m̄ bat起性地</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">老爸老母mā m̄ bat冤家lô債</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">感謝老母hōo我一个幸福、美滿、安定ê家</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kan-na ǹg望囝兒序細平安大漢</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tsit-má老母親像斜西ê月</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">永遠美麗</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台灣每一个老母lóng是án-ne</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">平凡又koh giám硬</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">媽媽若是親像天</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">對阮來講</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">老母永遠是天頂上光ê hit粒星</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">有影是</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">「手抱孩兒，tsiah知影爸母時」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tsit-má　阮做囡仔ê老爸</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tsiah體會著</span></p><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0 0 0 40px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">爸母ê平凡</span></p></blockquote><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">上珍貴mā上偉大</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><a name='more'></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhKzp6HKtFkMr9Z1oBGsfUFgBFMGJ7zUXnMSsmew_vt3-8sr-yHZmkG2ocKerUk2uEpFdhHdY2R8KGteXQMd9WMeTbqDf-gdoftKb5Dy0hyphenhyphen1DGy_9zTPzbIHqLfRdN-uKPIEISXJn0FXh6b5OIlSotbq5OOLKbSV4qCJrFLeOLQMkAI94lxqBHJ_TNvApsU/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1362%E6%9C%9F_4.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhKzp6HKtFkMr9Z1oBGsfUFgBFMGJ7zUXnMSsmew_vt3-8sr-yHZmkG2ocKerUk2uEpFdhHdY2R8KGteXQMd9WMeTbqDf-gdoftKb5Dy0hyphenhyphen1DGy_9zTPzbIHqLfRdN-uKPIEISXJn0FXh6b5OIlSotbq5OOLKbSV4qCJrFLeOLQMkAI94lxqBHJ_TNvApsU/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1362%E6%9C%9F_4.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><p><span></span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgr5b7g89EJzWaZej0x81gbwHN1k5wpIdOIpOF1PqE7wmKgZnJBE3lK4MifxxtNeLI3nwZK6phuK7k_YUgpfhan02noOhsnyDVnbf2D8FePOLPfSFMwXyfnx8jVOZ33e6z40aEJZnWj78K46Ja0XkCr8lzCObzRJto3hcOzPj6s_nwVo6m-mX9SRbrHAfs1/s1424/362%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgr5b7g89EJzWaZej0x81gbwHN1k5wpIdOIpOF1PqE7wmKgZnJBE3lK4MifxxtNeLI3nwZK6phuK7k_YUgpfhan02noOhsnyDVnbf2D8FePOLPfSFMwXyfnx8jVOZ33e6z40aEJZnWj78K46Ja0XkCr8lzCObzRJto3hcOzPj6s_nwVo6m-mX9SRbrHAfs1/w450-h640/362%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.j